    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You spent years roaming the highlands of Rashemen, a dangerous, windswept heath dotted with ancient obelisks enchanted to imprison Fiends and home to dragons, gnolls, and other deadly creatures. Friends are hard to come by in such a lonely land, and you have learned to keep strangers at arm's length.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.LUeMriAibyVJHhaW]{Tough}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Intimidation and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCartograph]{Cartographer's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCartograph]{Cartographer's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLanternHood]{Hooded Lantern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 23 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
